                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has some of the best sprite work I've seen, and a very present story for a metroidvania. In some ways it reminds me of Metroid Fusion, seeing as this is a rather linear game. A bit of an oddity for the genre but it allows it to have an actual structured storyline, and for my tastes it worked out. \r\n\r\nAs for the gameplay, it's a bit simpler than most other metroidvanias since you don't get too many upgrades to your kit but there are some, and you do get the satisfaction of clearing out the map at the end of the game as you do with most of these games. I highly recommend it.",
